  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hfg-gmuend/openmoji/tarball/17.0.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hfg-gmuend/openmoji/zipball/17.0.0",
  "body": "```\r\n\u262e\ufe0f\ud83c\udf40 OpenMoji 17.0 - 23 Apr 2026\r\n\r\nMany improvements, fixes and new OpenMojis:\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Full support of Unicode Emoji 17.0.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Redesign of the Japanese ideographic emojis\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude4f Special thanks to the mega contributors @nataliakeniganti and @cemoon95\r\n\r\nNew:\r\n  + Ballet Dancer, Trombone, Distorted Face by @nataliakeniganti #625\r\n  + Fight cloud by @nataliakeniganti #636\r\n  + Treasure chest and hairy creatur by Daniel Utz #636\r\n  + E070 extras-openmoji Bluesky by @agriyakhetarpal #557\r\n  + E1DA extras-openmoji \"ai hand\" by @artlung Joe Crawford #561\r\n  + 20E3 extras-openmoji combining enclosing keycap by @nataliakeniganti #565\r\n  + E420 to E435 extras-openmoji \ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08 Queer symbols by @felifluid Feli Berner #588\r\n  + E06F extras-openmoji facetime by @nataliakeniganti #638\r\n  + E06E extras-openmoji ecosia browser by @nataliakeniganti #638\r\n  + Chess pieces by @nataliakeniganti #605\r\n  + Yucatan and Queretaro flag @memburg #596\r\n  + Ontario and Queretaro flag by @jj-marr #627 #628\r\n\r\nImprovements:\r\n  * Fixing Japanese emoji and correcting legibility issues: 1F21A \ud83c\ude1a,\r\n    1F22F \ud83c\ude2f, 1F23A \ud83c\ude3a, 1F201 \ud83c\ude01, 1F202 \ud83c\ude02, 1F232 \ud83c\ude32, 1F233 \ud83c\ude33, 1F234 \ud83c\ude34,\r\n    1F235 \ud83c\ude35, 1F236 \ud83c\ude36, 1F237 \ud83c\ude37, 1F238 \ud83c\ude38, 1F239 \ud83c\ude39, 1F250 \ud83c\ude50, 1F251 \ud83c\ude51,\r\n    3299 \u3299, 3297 \u3297 by @cemoon95 #609\r\n  * Big general overhaul of symbols by @cemoon95 #616\r\n  * Emoji 17.0 changes\r\n    Moved extras-openmoji/landslide E09D > 1F6D8 by @nataliakeniganti #624\r\n    Moved extras-openmoji/orca E005 > 1FACD by @nataliakeniganti #624\r\n  * 270D better fingers of drawing hand by Daniel Utz\r\n  * 1F383 removed unnecessary points by @yukal #555\r\n  * font/README.md: easy font usage via jsdelivr.com by @jjb #570\r\n  * Improved South Korean flag by @cemoon95 #632\r\n  * Improved \ud83d\ude32\ud83d\ude27\ud83d\ude1e by @nataliakeniganti #631\r\n\r\nFix:\r\n  * Updates flag sequences of non rendering extras-openmoji/flags by @SoSeDiK #600\r\n    Berber Flag to use [ZWJ] between characters\r\n    True South Flag to use \ud83c\udff3 + [VS-16] + [ZWJ]+ \ud83e\uddca + [ZWJ] + \ud83d\udc8e\r\n    Browncoat Flag and colored Deep Flags to use RGI emoji versions of characters (\u2691 -> \ud83c\udff4, \u2605 -> \u2b50)\r\n    non-waving White Flag to use \ud83c\udff3 + [VS-16] + [ZWJ]+ \u2b1c\r\n  * Alabama & Washington DC flag codepoints by @SoSeDiK #639\r\n```",
